sequenceDiagram
  participant A as AI agent (Hermes or outside MCP client)
  participant G as Capability gateway
  participant L as Action ledger
  participant P as Owner's phone (passkey)
  participant D as Device adapter (e.g. greenhouse valve, robot arm)
  A->>G: tools/call greenhouse.zone2.open_valve
  G->>G: Who is the agent? Which user does it act for? Grant scope? Did it read untrusted (tainted) data?
  G->>L: Record request
  G-->>A: input_required: waiting for human approval
  G->>P: Push (opaque on iOS): "Agent wants to open valve 2 for 10 min"
  P->>G: Approve, signed with passkey
  G->>D: Execute within declared safety limits (TTL, max runtime)
  D-->>G: Done
  G->>L: Record result (hash-chained)
  G-->>A: Result
  Note over D: Safety limits live in the adapter and the device MCU, never in the AI model
